## Follow-up

Keep both engineering issues open until each mechanism has its own verified fix.
Test day-first locale interpretation separately from hint consistency; preserve
month-first behavior and booking-v2 coverage. Reconcile future exports by report ID,
retain anomalous observations, and compare arrivals with processing rather than
treating the merge count as the incident onset.

